   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1  Every view is one click from the sidebar.\n2  The Overview names the first action.\n3  Glossary and Close project are always present.\n4  Reviewing as (lens) never changes what the data says, only which checks you see.\n5  Phone: the same list becomes a stacked menu.",
